/backend/src/Maran.SharedKernel/Security/ @edgar2031

# The agent runs as root. `privs` is the only place `unsafe` is allowed, and the ordering
# there (fork, then drop; setgroups, setgid, setuid) is easy to get wrong and fatal when it is.
